# Exception: triage alias overrides are pipeline state (loaded by
# extract_relations at runtime) and must survive fresh clones.
!findata/Misc/relation_aliases.json
# Exception: quote-capture watchlist is the S0 tripwire lifecycle state
# (quote_coverage_audit.py) — gitignored triage state is lost on fresh
# clones (proposal S2/S0 amendment doctrine). Home: findata/Misc/ (S4
# follow-up — catch-all note + its state files live together).
!findata/Misc/quote_coverage_watchlist.json
# Exception: S2 resolver worklist (unresolved canonicals + fuzzy
# suggestions) and user-approved quote aliases (read by
# derive_insights._resolve_ladder) — same survive-fresh-clones doctrine.
!findata/Misc/quote_entity_worklist.json
!findata/Misc/quote_aliases.json
!findata/Misc/quote_stub_backlog.json
!findata/Misc/quote_g2_backlog.json
!findata/Misc/quote_g4sec_backlog.md
!findata/Misc/quote_g3_discards.jsonl
!findata/Misc/quote_accepted_losses.jsonl
# triage_pending_quotes run artifacts (regenerated each report run)
findata/Misc/quote_triage_report.md
findata/Misc/quote_triage_decisions.jsonl
